@UsersApiDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5195

### Get all users
GET {{UsersApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Get user by id
GET {{UsersApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Create user - current behavior while Auth0Management.Enabled = false
POST {{UsersApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Demo",
  "email": "usuario.demo@example.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Create user - use this body after Auth0Management.Enabled = true
POST {{UsersApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Auth0",
  "email": "usuario.auth0@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!",
  "isActive": true
}

### Update user
PUT {{UsersApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Actualizado",
  "email": "usuario.actualizado@example.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{UsersApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/users/1

### Check current user's permission
GET http://localhost:5195/api/authorization/check?permission=read:books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
